hadiths[114]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1204","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Aik aadmi Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aaya. To us ne kaha: Mujhey aisey amal ki raah dikhaaeye jo jihaad key baraabar ho. Aap ne farmaya: Main use nahi paata. Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum taaqat rakhtey ho ke jab mujaahid nikley to tum apni masjid mein daakhil ho aur khadey ho aur sust na ho aur rozah rakkho aur iftaar na karo? Us ne kaha: Aur kaun uski taaqat rakhta hai? (Bukhari: 2785)"
"1205","[AI-translation] Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Kaha gaya: Ya Rasulullah! Kaun log afzal hain? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Momin jo Allah key raastey mein apni jaan aur apne maal key sath jihaad karey. Unhon-ne kaha: Phir kaun? Aap ne farmaya: Momin jo ghaatiyon mein se ghaati mein ho, Allah se darey aur logon ko apni buraai se chhorey. (Bukhari: 2786)"
"1206","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Allah key raastey mein jihaad karney waley ki misaal, aur Allah zyada jaanta hai ke kaun uskey raastey mein jihaad karta hai, rozeydaar namaz padhney waley jaisi hai. Aur Allah ne Allah key raastey mein jihaad karney waley key liye zimma liya hai ke wo use faut kar key Jannat mein daakhil karega ya use salaamat wapas karega, ajr ya ganeemat key sath. (Bukhari: 2787)"
"1207","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Allah aur uskey Rasool par imaan laaey aur namaz qaem karey aur Ramazan key rozey rakkhey to Allah par haq hai ke wo use Jannat mein daakhil karey. Wo Allah key raastey mein jihaad karey ya apni us zameen mein baithey jahaan wo paida hua tha. To unhon-ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kya ham logon ko khushkhabri na dein? Aap ne farmaya: Beshak Jannat mein sau darjey hain jo Allah ne Allah key raastey mein jihaad karney walon key liye tayyaar kiye hain. Do darjon key darmiyaan aasmaan aur zameen jaisa faasla hai. Phir jab tum Allah se maango to us se Firdaus maango. Beshak wo Jannat ka darmiyaan aur Jannat ka buland hai. Mera khayaal hai uskey upar Rehman ka Arsh hai. Aur us se Jannat ki nehrein phoot-ten hain. (Bukhari: 2790)"
"1208","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Allah key raastey mein subah ya shaam ka chalna duniya aur jo us mein hai us se behtar hai. (Bukhari: 2792)"
"1209","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Jannat mein kamaan key baraabar jagah us se behtar hai jis par sooraj nikalta aur ghurub hota hai. Aur farmaya: Allah key raastey mein subah ya shaam ka chalna us se behtar hai jis par sooraj nikalta aur ghurub hota hai. (Bukhari: 2793). Hooron aur unki sifat."
"1210","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai: Agar Jannat walon mein se aurat zameen walon ki taraf jhaankey to un donon key darmiyaan roshan kar dey aur use khushbu se bhar dey. Aur uska dupatta uskey sar par duniya aur jo us mein hai us se behtar hai. (Bukhari: 2796)"
"1211","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Bani Sulaim mein se qaum ko Bani Aamir ki taraf sattar mein bheja. Phir jab wo pahunchey to un se merey maamun ne kaha: Main tum se aagey badhta hun. Phir agar wo mujhey aman dein yahan tak ke main unhey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki taraf se pahunchaun, warna tum mujh se qareeb hoge. To wo aagey badhey aur unhon-ne use aman di. Phir jabke wo unhey Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki taraf se bayan kar rahey they ke un mein se aik aadmi ki taraf ishaara kya gaya aur us ne use nezah maara aur paar kar diya. To us ne kaha: Allahu Akbar! Kaaba key Rab ki qasam main kaamyaab ho gaya! Phir wo uskey baaqi saathiyon par jhukay aur unhey qatl kya magar langdey aadmi key siwa jo pahaad par chadh gaya. To Jibreel (Alaihissalam) ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko khabar di ke wo apne Rab se milay hain aur wo un se raazi hua hai aur unhey raazi kya hai. To ham padhtey they ke apni qaum ko pahuncha do ke ham apne Rab se milay hain aur wo ham se raazi hua hai aur us ne hamein raazi kya hai. Phir uskey baad mansookh hua. To Aap ne un par chaalees subah baddua ki: Ril aur Zakwaan aur Bani Lihyaan aur Bani Usayya par jinhon-ne Allah aur uskey Rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki naafarmaani ki thi. (Bukhari: 2801)"
"1212","[AI-translation] Jundub bin Sufyan (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) baaz mashahidon mein they jabke Aapki ungli khooni ho gai thi. To Aap ne farmaya: Tum sirf ungli ho jo khooni hui ho. Aur Allah key raastey mein tum ne jo paaya hai. (Bukhari: 2802)"
"1213","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Qasam us zaat ki jiskey haath mein meri jaan hai! Allah key raastey mein jo zakhmi kya jaata hai, aur Allah zyada jaanta hai ke kaun uskey raastey mein zakhmi kya jaata hai, wo Qiyaamat key din aaeyga jabke rang khoon ka rang hoga aur khushbu musk ki khushbu hogi. (Bukhari: 2803)"
"1214","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Merey chacha Anas bin Nazr (Raziallahu anhu) Badr ki ladai se ghaaeb rahey. To unhon-ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Main pehli ladai se ghaaeb raha jis mein tum ne mushrikeen se jang ki. Beshak agar Allah mujhey mushrikeen se ladna dikhaaey to Allah zaroor dekhega ke main kya karta hun. Phir jab Uhad ka din tha aur Musalman hat gaey to unhon-ne kaha: Ae Allah! Beshak main teri taraf uzr karta hun jo inhon-ne kya, yaani Aap key sahaaba, aur teri taraf baraan hon jo inhon-ne kya, yaani mushrikeen. Phir aagey badhey aur unhey Saad bin Muaz milay. To unhon-ne kaha: Ae Saad bin Muaz! Nazr key Rab ki qasam Jannat! Beshak main uski khushbu Uhad se neechey paata hun. Saad ne kaha: To Ya Rasulullah main taaqat na rakkh saka jo us ne kya. Anas ne kaha: To ham ne us mein assi se zyada talwaar ki maar ya nezeh ki chot ya teer ka zakhm paaey. Aur ham ne use qatl kya hua paaya jabke mushrikeen ne uska musla kya tha. To use koi na pehchaan saka magar uski behan ne uski ungli se. Anas ne kaha: Ham samajhtey ya gumaan kartey they ke ye aayat uskey aur us jaison key baarey mein naazil hui: (Mominon mein aadmi hain jinhon-ne sach kya jo unhon-ne Allah se ahd kya tha) aayat key aakhir tak. (Bukhari: 2805)"
"1215","[AI-translation] Aur unhon-ne kaha: Beshak uski behan jiska naam Rubayyi tha us ne aurat ka saamney ka daant tod diya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne qisaas ka hukm diya. To Anas ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Qasam us zaat ki jis ne tumhey haq key sath bheja! Uska saamney ka daant kabhi na toda jaaeyga. To wo diyat par raazi ho gaey aur qisaas chhor diya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah key bandon mein se koi hai ke agar wo Allah par qasam khaey to Allah use poora karega. (Bukhari: 2806)"
"1216","[AI-translation] Bara (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas lohey mein dhaka hua aadmi aaya. To us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Main ladun ya Musalman hun? Aap ne farmaya: Musalman ho, phir lado. To wo Musalman hua, phir lada aur qatl kya gaya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Us ne thoda amal kya aur bahut ajr paaya. (Bukhari: 2808)"
"1217","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Bara ki beti Haaritha bin Suraaqa ki waalida Umm Rubayyi Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aaein. To unhon-ne kaha: Ae Allah key Nabi! Kya tum mujhey Haaritha key baarey mein na bataaogey. Aur wo Badr key din qatl kya gaya tha, use anjaana teer laga tha. Phir agar wo Jannat mein hai to main sabr karungi. Aur agar wo uskey siwa hai to us par roney mein koshish karungi. Aap ne farmaya: Ae Haaritha ki maan! Beshak wo Jannat mein jannatein hain. Aur beshak tumhaara beta Firdaus-e-Aala mein pahuncha hai. (Bukhari: 2809)"
"1218","[AI-translation] Abu Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Aik aadmi Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aaya. To us ne kaha: Aadmi maal-e-ganeemat key liye ladta hai. Aur aadmi naam key liye ladta hai. Aur aadmi ladta hai taake uski jagah dekhi jaey. To kaun Allah key raastey mein hai? Aap ne farmaya: Jo ladey taake Allah ka kalimat buland ho to wo Allah key raastey mein hai. (Bukhari: 2810)"
"1219","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab Khandaq key din wapas aey aur hathiyaar rakkhey aur ghusl kya. To Aap key paas Jibreel aey jabke unkey sar ko gubaar ne baandha hua tha. To unhon-ne kaha: Tum ne hathiyaar rakkhey. Allah ki qasam main ne nahi rakkhey. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: To kahaan? Unhon-ne kaha: Yahaan. Aur Bani Quraiza ki taraf ishaara kya. Unhon-ne kaha: To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unki taraf nikley. (Bukhari: 2813)"
"1220","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah do aadmiyon par hansta hai jinkey aik doosrey ko qatl karta hai, wo donon Jannat mein daakhil hotey hain. Ye Allah key raastey mein ladta hai aur qatl kya jaata hai. Phir Allah qaatil par tauba karta hai aur wo shaheed kya jaata hai. (Bukhari: 2826)"
"1221","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se) riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aaya jabke Aap Khaibar mein they, usey fatah karney key baad. To main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Merey liye hissa rakkhiye. To Bani Saeed bin Aas mein se baaz ne kaha: Uskey liye hissa na rakkhiye Ya Rasulullah! To Abu Hurairah ne kaha: Ye Ibn Qauqal ka qaatil hai. To Ibn Saeed bin Aas ne kaha: Bakri key bachchey par taajjub hai jo ham par bakri key bachchey key aamad se utra hai, wo mujh par Musalman aadmi key qatl ka tana deta hai jise Allah ne merey haathon izzat di aur mujhey uskey haathon zaleel nahi kya. (Bukhari: 2827)"
"1222","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Abu Talha Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key zamaaney mein ghazwe ki wajah se rozah na rakhtey they. Phir jab Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) faut ho gaey to main ne unhey iftaar kartey huey nahi dekha magar Eid-ul-Fitr ya Baqra Eid key din. (Bukhari: 2828)"
"1223","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Taoon har Musalman key liye shahaadat hai. (Bukhari: 2830)"
"1224","[AI-translation] Zaid bin Saabit (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne un par (Baithney waley momin aur Allah key raastey mein jihaad karney waley baraabar nahi hain) imla karaai. Unhon-ne kaha: To Aap key paas Ibn Umm Maktoom aey jabke Aap mujh par imla karaa rahey they. To us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Agar main jihaad ki taaqat rakhta to jihaad karta. Aur wo andha aadmi tha. To Allah ne apne Rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par naazil farmaya jabke Aapki raan meri raan par thi. To wo mujh par bhaari hui yahan tak ke mujhey khauf hua ke meri raan kuchal jaaeygi. Phir Aap se (wo kefiyat) door hui. To Allah ne naazil farmaya: (Uzr walon key siwa). (Bukhari: 2832)"
"1225","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Khandaq ki taraf nikley jabke Muhaajireen aur Ansaar sard subah khod rahey they. To unkey paas ghulaam na they jo wo unkey liye kartey. Phir jab Aap ne unki mehnat aur bhook dekhi to farmaya: Ae Allah! Beshak zindagi aakhirat ki zindagi hai. To Ansaar aur Muhaajireen ko maaf farma. To unhon-ne Aap ko jawaab detey huey kaha: Ham wo hain jinhon-ne Muhammad se jihaad par baiat ki jab tak ham baaqi rahein. (Bukhari: 2834)"
"1226","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Anas Raziallahu anhu se) aik riwayat mein hai ke wo kehtey they: Ham wo hain jinhon-ne Muhammad se Islam par baiat ki jab tak ham baaqi rahein. Aur Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unhey jawaab detey aur farmaatey: Ae Allah! Beshak bhalai nahi magar aakhirat ki bhalai. To Ansaar aur Muhaajireen mein barkat dey. (Bukhari: 2835)"
"1227","[AI-translation] Bara (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko Ahzaab key din mitti uthaatey huey dekha jabke mitti ne Aap key pet ki safedi ko dhaanp diya tha. Aur Aap farma rahey they: Agar tu na hota to ham hidaayat na paatey aur na sadqa kartey aur na namaz padhtey. To ham par sukoon naazil farma. Aur qadmon ko saabit rakkh agar ham milain. Beshak unhon-ne ham par zulm kya hai. Jab wo fitna chaahtey hain to ham inkaar kartey hain. (Bukhari: 2837)"
"1228","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ghazwe mein they. To Aap ne farmaya: Beshak Madina mein qaumein hamaarey peechey hain. Ham ne koi ghaati aur na waadi tay nahi ki magar wo hamarey sath us mein hain. Unhey uzr ne rok diya hai. (Bukhari: 2839)"
"1229","[AI-translation] Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Jo Allah key raastey mein din rozah rakkhey to Allah uska chehra aag se sattar saal door karega. (Bukhari: 2840)"
"1230","[AI-translation] Zaid bin Khaalid (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Allah key raastey mein ghazi ko tayyaar karey to us ne ghazwa kya. Aur jo Allah key raastey mein ghazi key peechey bhalai key sath qaem rahey to us ne ghazwa kya. (Bukhari: 2843)"
"1231","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Madina mein Umm Sulaim key ghar key siwa ghar mein daakhil na hotey they, apni biwiyon key siwa. To Aap se kaha gaya. To Aap ne farmaya: Beshak main us par rehem karta hun, uska bhai merey sath qatl kya gaya tha. (Bukhari: 2844)"
"1232","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Anas Raziallahu anhu se) riwayat hai ke wo Yamaama key din Saabit bin Qais key paas aey jabke us ne apni raanon se (kapda) hataaya hua tha aur wo khushbu lagaa raha tha. To us ne kaha: Ae chacha! Tumhey kya rokta hai ke tum na aao? Us ne kaha: Abhi ae merey bhatijay! Aur wo khushbu lagaata raha, yaani hanoot mein se. Phir aaya aur baitha. To hadees mein logon key hatney ka zikr kya. To us ne kaha: Hamaarey chehron se aisa yahan tak ke ham qaum se ladain. Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath aisa nahi kartey they. Tum ne apne baraabar walon ko bura sikhaaya hai. (Bukhari: 2845)"
"1233","[AI-translation] Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kaun merey paas qaum ki khabar laaeyga? Ahzaab key din. Zubair ne kaha: Main. Phir farmaya: Kaun merey paas qaum ki khabar laaeyga? Zubair ne kaha: Main. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak har Nabi ka hawaari hota hai aur mera hawaari Zubair hai. (Bukhari: 2846)"
"1234","[AI-translation] Urwa Baariqi (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ghodon ki peshaaniyon mein Qiyaamat key din tak bhalai bandhi hui hai: Ajr aur ganeemat. (Bukhari: 2852)"
"1235","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Barkat ghodon ki peshaaniyon mein hai. (Bukhari: 2851)"
"1236","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Allah key raastey mein ghoda rok rakkhey, Allah par imaan aur uskey waadey ki tasdeeq mein, to beshak uska pet bharna aur uska seeraab hona aur uski leed aur uska peshaab Qiyaamat key din uskey taraazu mein hoga. (Bukhari: 2853)"
"1237","[AI-translation] Sahl (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka hamaarey baagh mein ghoda tha jisey Luhayf ya Lukhayf kaha jaata tha. (Bukhari: 2855)"
"1238","[AI-translation] Muaz (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key peechey gadhey par sawaar tha jisey Ufair kaha jaata tha. To Aap ne farmaya: Ae Muaz! Kya tum jaantey ho ke Allah ka apne bandon par haq kya hai? Aur hadees bayan ki aur wo guzar chuki hai. (Bukhari: 2856)"
"1239","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Madina mein khauf hua. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamaara ghoda mustaar liya jisey Mandoob kaha jaata tha. To Aap ne farmaya: Ham ne khauf nahi dekha. Aur beshak ham ne use samandar paaya hai. (Bukhari: 2857)"
"1240","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Beshak nahoosat teen mein hai: Ghodey mein aur aurat mein aur ghar mein. (Bukhari: 2858)"
"1241","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se) riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ghodey key liye do hissey aur uskey maalik key liye aik hissa rakkha. (Bukhari: 2863)"
"1242","[AI-translation] Bara bin Aazib (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke un se aik aadmi ne kaha: Kya tum Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se Hunain key din bhaagay? Unhon-ne kaha: Lekin Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) na bhaagay. Beshak Hawaazin teerandaaz qaum they. Aur beshak jab ham un se milay to ham ne un par hamla kya aur wo bhaagay. To Musalman maal-e-ganeemat ki taraf aey aur unhon-ne hamara teeron se isteqbaal kya. Lekin Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) na bhaagay. To main ne Aap ko dekha jabke Aap apne safed khachchar par they jabke Abu Sufyan uski lagaam pakdey huey they. Aur Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farma rahey they: Main Nabi hun jhoot nahi. Main Abdul Muttalib ka beta hun. (Bukhari: 2864)"
"1243","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki oontni thi jisey Azbaa kaha jaata tha jo peechey na rehti thi. To dehaati jawaan oont par aaya aur us se aagey nikal gaya. To wo Musalmaanon par giraan guzra yahan tak ke Aap ne use pehchaana. To Aap ne farmaya: Allah par haq hai ke duniya mein jo cheez buland ho use wo neecha karey. (Bukhari: 2872)"
"1244","[AI-translation] Umar bin Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Madina ki auraton mein se auraton key darmiyaan chaadarein taqseem kein. To achhi chaadar bachi. To unkey paas jo they un mein se baaz ne un se kaha: Ae Ameer-ul-Momineen! Ye Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki beti ko dijiye jo tumharey paas hain. Wo Umm Kulsoom bint Ali chaahtey they. To Umar ne kaha: Umm Sulait zyada haqdaar hai. Aur Umm Sulait Ansaar ki auraton mein se hain jinhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se baiat ki thi. Umar ne kaha: Beshak wo Uhad key din hamaarey liye mashkeezein laati thein. (Bukhari: 2881)"
"1245","[AI-translation] Rubayyi bint Muawwiz (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath ghazwa karti thein. Ham pilaati thein aur zakhmiyon ki marham patti karti thein aur maqtoolon ko Madina wapas laati thein. (Bukhari: 2883)"
"1246","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) raat ko jaagtey. Phir jab Aap Madina tashreef laaey to farmaya: Kaash mera koi nek saathi aaj raat meri hifaazat karta. Jab ham ne hathiyaar ki aawaaz suni to Aap ne farmaya: Ye kaun hai? To us ne kaha: Main Saad bin Abi Waqqaas hun, tumhaari hifaazat key liye aaya hun. Aur Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) so gaey. (Bukhari: 2885)"
"1247","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Halaak ho deenaar ka banda aur dirham ka banda aur chaadar ka banda! Agar diya jaey to raazi hota hai aur agar na diya jaey to naaraaz hota hai. Halaak ho aur undha ho aur jab kaanta chubhey to na nikley. Khushkhabri ho us bandey key liye jo Allah key raastey mein apne ghodey ki baag pakdey huey hai jabke uska sar bikhra hua hai aur uskey qadam gubaar aalood hain. Agar wo pehrey mein ho to pehrey mein ho. Aur agar wo peechey ho to peechey ho. Agar wo ijazat maangey to use ijazat na di jaey. Aur agar wo sifaarish karey to uski sifaarish qabool na ki jaey. (Bukhari: 2887)"
"1248","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath Khaibar ki taraf nikla taake Aapki khidmat karun. Phir jab Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) wapas tashreef laaey aur Aap par Uhad zaahir hua to Aap ne farmaya: Ye pahaad hai jo ham se mohabbat rakhta hai aur ham us se mohabbat rakhtey hain. (Bukhari: 2889)"
"1249","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Anas Raziallahu anhu se) riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath they. Ham mein sab se zyada saaya wala wo tha jo apni chaadar se saaya karta tha. Aur jo rozey se they unhon-ne kuchh kaam nahi kya. Aur jo iftaar se they unhon-ne sawaariyaan bhejin aur mehnat ki aur ilaaj kya. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aaj iftaar waley ajr ley gaey. (Bukhari: 2890)"
"1250","[AI-translation] Sahl bin Saad Saaedi (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah key raastey mein din bhar pehra duniya aur jo us par hai us se behtar hai. Aur tum mein se kisi key kodey ki jagah Jannat mein duniya aur jo us par hai us se behtar hai. Aur banda jo Allah key raastey mein shaam ya subah chalta hai wo duniya aur jo us par hai us se behtar hai. (Bukhari: 2892). Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Abu Talha se farmaya: Apne ladkon mein se ladka talaash karo jo meri khidmat karey yahan tak ke main Khaibar ki taraf niklun. To Abu Talha mujhey apne peechey sawaar kar key nikley jabke main ladka tha jo balooghat key qareeb tha. To main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat karta tha jab Aap utartey. To main Aap ko aksar kehtey huey sunta tha: Ae Allah! Beshak main fikr aur gham se, aur aajizi aur susti se, aur bakheeli aur buzdili se, aur qarz key bojh aur aadmiyon key ghalbe se teri panaah maangta hun. Phir ham Khaibar aey. Phir jab Allah ne us par qila fatah kya to us se Safiya bint Huyayy bin Akhtab key husn ka zikr kya gaya. Jabke uska shohar qatl kya gaya tha aur wo dulhan thi. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne use apne liye muntakhib kya. To Aap usey ley kar nikley yahan tak ke ham Sadd-us-Sahba tak pahunchey. Wo halaal huin aur Aap ne un se nikaah kya. Phir chhoti chaadar mein hais banaaya. Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Apne gird walon ko khabar do. To wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka Safiya par waleema tha. Phir ham Madina ki taraf nikley. Unhon-ne kaha: To main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekha ke Aap unkey liye apne peechey aba se god banaatey. Phir Aap apne oont key paas baithtey aur apna ghutna rakhtey. To Safiya apna paon Aap key ghutney par rakhten yahan tak ke sawaar hoten. To ham chaley yahan tak ke jab ham Madina par zaahir huey to Aap ne Uhad ki taraf dekha aur farmaya: Ye pahaad hai jo ham se mohabbat rakhta hai aur ham us se mohabbat rakhtey hain. Phir Aap ne Madina ki taraf dekha aur farmaya: Ae Allah! Beshak main uskey donon kinaron key darmiyaan hurmat wala karaar deta hun jaisey Ibrahim ne Makkah ko hurmat wala karaar diya tha. Ae Allah! Unkey mud aur saa mein barkat dey. (2893). Ye hadees Ziya-ud-Daaghistani key zawaed mein se hai aur Zabidi key asl mein se nahi hai."

"1251","[AI-translation] Saad (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya tum apne kamzoron key sath hi madad diye jaatey ho aur rizq diye jaatey ho. (Bukhari: 2896)"
"1252","[AI-translation] Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Zamaana aaeyga ke logon ke giroh ghazwa karengey. To kaha jaaeyga: Kya tum mein wo hai jis ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki sohbat paai hai? To kaha jaaeyga: Haan. To us par fatah hogi. Phir zamaana aaeyga aur kaha jaaeyga: Kya tum mein wo hai jis ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sahaaba ki sohbat paai hai? To kaha jaaeyga: Haan. To fatah hogi. Phir zamaana aaeyga aur kaha jaaeyga: Kya tum mein wo hai jis ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sahaaba key saathi ki sohbat paai hai? To kaha jaaeyga: Haan. To fatah hogi. (Bukhari: 2897)"
"1253","[AI-translation] Abu Usaid (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Badr key din farmaya jab ham ne Quraish key liye safein baandhein aur unhon-ne hamaarey liye safein baandhein: Jab wo tumharey qareeb aaen to tum par teer hain. (Bukhari: 2900)"
"1254","[AI-translation] Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Bani Nazeer key maal Allah ne apne Rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par maal-e-fai kya tha jo Musalmanon ne ghodon aur oonton se haasil nahi kya tha. To wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key liye khaas they. Aur Aap apne ghar walon par unkey saal bhar ka kharcha kharch kartey, phir jo bachta use hathiyaar aur ghodey mein Allah key raastey mein tayyaari mein rakhtey. (Bukhari: 2904)"
"1255","[AI-translation] Ali (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko Saad key baad aadmi par fidya kehtey huey nahi dekha. Main ne Aap ko farmatey huey suna: Teer chalaao, tum par merey maan baap qurbaan! (Bukhari: 2905)"
"1256","[AI-translation] Abu Umaama (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Beshak qaum ne fathen haasil kein jabke unki talwaaron ka zewar sona aur chaandi na tha. Beshak unka zewar chamda aur seesha aur loha tha. (Bukhari: 2909)"
"1257","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne khe mey mein farmaya: Ae Allah! Beshak main tujh se tera ahd aur tera waada maangta hun. Ae Allah! Agar tu chaahe to aaj key baad ibaadat na ki jaey. To Abu Bakr ne Aapka haath pakda aur kaha: Bas karo Ya Rasulullah! Beshak tum ne apne Rab se bahut ilteja ki hai. Jabke Aap zirah mein they. To Aap nikley jabke farma rahey they: (Jald giroh shikast khaaeyga aur peeth morengey. Balke Qiyaamat unka waada hai aur Qiyaamat zyada sakht aur kadwi hai). (Bukhari: 2915)"
"1258","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Abdur Rahman bin Auf aur Zubair bin Awwaam ko resham mein rukhsat di thi, unki khujli ki wajah se. (Bukhari: 2919)"
"1259","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se aik riwayat mein hai ke un donon ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se shikaayat ki, yaani juon ki, to Aap ne un donon ko resham mein rukhsat di. (Bukhari: 2921)"
"1260","[AI-translation] Umm Haraam (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Meri ummat ka pehla lashkar jo samandar mein ghazwa karega us par waajib ho gaya hai. Unhon-ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kya main un mein hun? Aap ne farmaya: Tum un mein ho. Phir Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Meri ummat ka pehla lashkar jo Qaisar key shehar mein ghazwa karega usey maaf kar diya gaya hai. To main ne kaha: Kya main un mein hun Ya Rasulullah? Aap ne farmaya: Nahi. (Bukhari: 2924)"
"1261","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum Yahood se ladogey yahan tak ke un mein se aik patthar key peechey chhupega. To wo kahega: Ae Allah key bandey! Ye Yahoodi merey peechey hai, use qatl karo. Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Qiyaamat qaem na hogi yahan tak ke tum Yahood se lado. Aur baaqi hadees zikr ki. (Bukhari: 2925)"
"1262","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Qiyaamat qaem na hogi yahan tak ke tum Turkon se lado jo chhoti aankhon waley, surkh chehron waley, chapti naakon waley hongey, goya unkey chehrey hathodi se pitee huey dhaal hain. Aur Qiyaamat qaem na hogi yahan tak ke tum qaum se lado jinkey jootey baal key hongey. (Bukhari: 2928)"
"1263","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Abi Aufa (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Ahzaab key din mushrikeen par baddua ki aur farmaya: Ae Allah! Kitaab naazil karney waley, jald hisaab lenay waley! Ae Allah! Girohon ko shikast dey! Ae Allah! Unhey shikast dey aur unhey hila dey! (Bukhari: 2933)"
"1264","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Yahood Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas daakhil huey aur unhon-ne kaha: Tum par maut ho! To main ne unhey laanat ki. To Aap ne farmaya: Tumhey kya hua? Main ne kaha: Kya tum ne nahi suna jo unhon-ne kaha? Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum ne nahi suna jo main ne kaha: Aur tum par. (Bukhari: 2935)"
"1265","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Tufail bin Amr Dausi aur uskey sahaaba Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aey. To unhon-ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak Daus ne naafarmaani ki hai aur inkaar kya hai, to Allah se us par baddua kijiye. To kaha gaya: Daus halaak hui. Aap ne farmaya: Ae Allah! Daus ko hidaayat dey aur unhey ley aa. (Bukhari: 2937)"
"1266","[AI-translation] Sahl bin Saad (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko Khaibar key din farmatey huey suna: Main jhanda zaroor aisey aadmi ko dunga jiskey haathon Allah fatah dega. To wo uthay aur uskey liye ummeed rakhtay ke un mein se kisko diya jaaeyga. To subah huey jabke wo sab ummeed rakhtay they ke diya jaaeyga. To Aap ne farmaya: Ali kahaan hain? To kaha gaya: Wo apni aankhon ki shikaayat kartey hain. To Aap ne hukm diya aur unhey uskey liye bulaaya gaya. To Aap ne unki aankhon mein luaab lagaaya aur wo usi jagah theek ho gaey yahan tak ke goya unhey kuchh tha hi nahi. To us ne kaha: Ham un se ladengey yahan tak ke wo hamarey jaisey ho jaaein? To Aap ne farmaya: Aaraam se yahan tak ke unkey maidaan mein utro. Phir unhey Islam ki daawat do aur unhey khabar do jo un par waajib hai. To Allah ki qasam! Tumhaarey sath aik aadmi ko hidaayat milna tumharey liye surkh oonton se behtar hai. (Bukhari: 2942)"
"1267","[AI-translation] Kaab bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Kam hi hota tha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) safar mein nikaltey jab nikaltey magar Jumueraat key din. (Bukhari: 2949)"
"1268","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein lashkar mein bheja aur ham se farmaya: Agar tum fulaan aur fulaan ko paao, Quraish mein se do aadmiyon key liye jinkey Aap ne naam liye they, to unhey aag se jala dena. Unhon-ne kaha: Phir ham Aap key paas aey aur Aap ko alwidaa kaha jab ham nikalna chaaahtey they. To Aap ne farmaya: Beshak main ne tumhey hukm diya tha ke tum fulaan aur fulaan ko aag se jalao. Aur aag se azaab sirf Allah deta hai. Phir agar tum unhey paao to unhey qatl kar dena. (Bukhari: 2954)"
"1269","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Sunna aur itaat karna haq hai jab tak gunaah ka hukm na diya jaey. Phir jab gunaah ka hukm diya jaey to na sunna hai aur na itaat. (Bukhari: 2955)"
"1270","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Ham pichhley agley hain. (Bukhari: 2956)"
"1271","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham aaney waley saal wapas aey aur ham mein se do us darkht par jama na huey jiskey neechey ham ne baiat ki thi. Wo Allah ki taraf se rehmat thi. To un se kaha gaya: Tum ne un se kis par baiat ki thi, maut par? Unhon-ne kaha: Nahi, balke unhon-ne un se sabr par baiat ki thi. (Bukhari: 2958)"
"1272","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Zaid (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Jab Harra ka zamaana tha to unkey paas aaney wala aaya. To us ne un se kaha: Beshak Ibn Hanzala logon se maut par baiat ley raha hai. To unhon-ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key baad is par kisi se baiat na karunga. (Bukhari: 2959)"
"1273","[AI-translation] Salma bin Akwa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se baiat ki, phir darkht key saayey ki taraf hata. Phir jab log kam ho gaey to Aap ne farmaya: Ae Ibn Akwa! Kya tum baiat na karogey? Unhon-ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Main baiat kar chuka hun Ya Rasulullah! Aap ne farmaya: Aur phir. To main ne doosri martaba baiat ki. To un se kaha gaya: Tum us din kis par baiat kar rahey they? Unhon-ne kaha: Maut par. (Bukhari: 2960)"
"1274","[AI-translation] Mujaashi (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aaya, main aur mera bhai. To main ne kaha: Ham se hijrat par baiat lijiye. To Aap ne farmaya: Hijrat uskey walon key liye guzar chuki hai. To main ne kaha: Tum ham se kis par baiat letey ho? Aap ne farmaya: Islam aur jihaad par. (Bukhari: 2963)"
"1275","[AI-translation] Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Aaj merey paas aadmi aaya aur us ne mujh se muamley key baarey mein poochha jiska main jawaab na jaanta tha. To us ne kaha: Bataaiye aisey aadmi key baarey mein jo ada karney wala phurteela ho jo hamaarey ameeron key sath ghazwaat mein nikalta hai aur ham par aisi cheezon mein qasam deta hai jiney ham shumaar nahi kar saktey? To main ne us se kaha: Allah ki qasam! Main nahi jaanta ke main tum se kya kahun magar ye ke ham Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath they. To shayed wo ham par muamley mein aik martaba key siwa qasam na detey yahan tak ke ham use kartey. Aur beshak tum mein se koi bhalai mein rahega jab tak wo Allah se darey. Aur jab uskey dil mein koi cheez shak mein daaley to aadmi se poochhey aur wo use us se shifa dey. Aur qareeb hai ke tum use na paao. Aur qasam us zaat ki jiskey siwa koi mabood nahi! Main duniya mein se jo guzra usey talab key siwa nahi yaad rakhta jiska saaf piya gaya aur uska ganda baaqi raha. (Bukhari: 2964)"
"1276","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Abi Aufa (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apne baaz un dinon mein jin mein Aap milay they intezaar kartey yahan tak ke sooraj dhal jaata. Phir logon mein khateeb ho kar khadey hotey aur farmatey: Ae logon! Dushman se milney ki tamanna na karo aur Allah se aafiyat maango. Phir jab tum un se milo to sabr karo. Aur jaan lo ke Jannat talwaaron key saayon key neechey hai. Phir farmaya: Ae Allah! Kitaab naazil karney waley! Aur baaqi dua guzar chuki hai. (Bukhari: 2966)"
"1277","[AI-translation] Yala bin Umayya (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne mazdoor kiraayey par liya. To aadmi ne aadmi se ladai ki aur un mein se aik ne doosrey ko kaata. To us ne apna haath uskey munh se kheench liya aur uska saamney ka daant nikaal diya. To wo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aaya. To Aap ne use zaaya karaar diya aur farmaya: Kya wo apna haath tumhaari taraf badhaaey aur tum use kaato jaisey saannd kaat-ta hai. (Bukhari: 2973)"
"1278","[AI-translation] Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Zubair (Raziallahu anhu) se kaha: Yahaan tumhey Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne jhanda gaadney ka hukm diya tha. (Bukhari: 2976)"
"1279","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Main jaame kalimat key sath bheja gaya hun. Aur rob key sath meri madad ki gai hai. Phir jabke main soya hua tha ke merey paas zameen key khazaanon ki chaabiyaan laai gaein aur merey haath mein rakkhi gaein. Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha: Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jaa chukey hain jabke tum unhey nikaal rahey ho. (Bukhari: 2977)"
"1280","[AI-translation] Abu Bakr ki beti Asma (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah ka safar ka tosha Abu Bakr key ghar mein banaaya jab Aap Madina ki taraf hijrat karna chaaahtey they. Unhon-ne kaha: To ham ne Aap key toshay aur Aapki mashk key liye wo na paaya jis se ham unhey baandhein. To main ne Abu Bakr se kaha: Allah ki qasam! Main kuchh nahi paatin jis se baandhun magar apna kamarband. Unhon-ne kaha: To use do mein cheero. To aik se mashk baandho aur doosrey se tosha. To main ne aisa kya. To isliye mera naam Zaat-un-Nitaaqain pada. (Bukhari: 2979)"
"1281","[AI-translation] Usaama bin Zaid (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) gadhey par sawaar huey jis par kaathi thi jis par qateefa tha. Aur Usaama ko apne peechey sawaar kya. (Bukhari: 2987)"
"1282","[AI-translation] Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Fatah key din Makkah key baalaai hissey se apni oontni par tashreef laaey jabke Aap ne Usaama bin Zaid ko apne peechey sawaar kya hua tha. Aur Aap key sath Bilaal they. Aur Aap key sath daarbano mein se Usmaan bin Talha they yahan tak ke Aap ne masjid mein oont bithaaya. To Aap ne use hukm diya ke wo Bait ki chaabi laaey. To us ne khola aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) daakhil huey. Aur baaqi hadees guzar chuki hai. (Bukhari: 2988). Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Logon key har jod par sadqa hai har din jis mein sooraj nikalta hai. Do key darmiyaan insaaf karna sadqa hai. Aur aadmi ki uski sawaari par madad karna, use us par sawaar karna ya us par uska saamaan uthaana sadqa hai. Aur achhi baat sadqa hai. Aur har qadam jo wo namaz ki taraf uthaata hai sadqa hai. Aur raastey se takleef door karna sadqa hai. (2989). Ye hadees Ziya-ud-Daaghistani key zawaed mein se hai aur Zabidi key asl mein se nahi hai."
"1283","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne dushman ki zameen ki taraf Quran ley kar safar karney se mana kya hai. (Bukhari: 2990)"
"1284","[AI-translation] Abu Musa Ashaari (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath they. To ham jab waadi par zaahir hotey to Tahlil aur takbeer kehtey aur hamaari aawaazein buland hoten. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ae logon! Apne aap par narmi karo. Beshak tum behrey aur ghaaeb ko nahi pukaartey. Beshak wo tumharey sath hai. Beshak wo Sun-ney wala Qareeb hai. Uska naam mubaarak hai aur uski azmat buland hai. (Bukhari: 2992)"
"1285","[AI-translation] Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham jab chadhtey to takbeer kehtey aur jab utartey to tasbeeh kehtey. (Bukhari: 2994)"
"1286","[AI-translation] Abu Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab banda beemaar ho ya safar karey to uskey liye waisa likha jaata hai jaisa wo muqeem tandrust hota hua karta tha. (Bukhari: 2996)"
"1287","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Kaash log jaantey jo tanhai mein hai jo main jaanta hun. Koi sawaar raat ko akeley safar na karta. (Bukhari: 2998)"
"1288","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Amr (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Aik aadmi Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aaya aur Aap se jihaad mein ijazat maangi. To Aap ne farmaya: Kya tumharey maan baap zinda hain? Us ne kaha: Haan. Aap ne farmaya: To un donon mein jihaad karo. (Bukhari: 3004)"
"1289","[AI-translation] Abu Basheer Ansaari (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath Aap key baaz safaron mein they jabke log apne raat guzaarney mein they. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne bhejaney wala bheja ke oont ki gardan mein taant ka haar ya haar baaqi na rahey magar kaata jaey. (Bukhari: 3005)"
"1290","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Aadmi aurat key sath tanhai na karey. Aur aurat safar na karey magar uskey sath mehram ho. To aik aadmi khada hua aur us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Mera naam fulaan fulaan ghazwe mein likha gaya hai aur meri biwi Hajj key liye nikli hai? Aap ne farmaya: Jao aur apni biwi key sath Hajj karo. (Bukhari: 3006)"
"1291","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Allah qaum par taajjub karta hai jo Jannat mein zanjeeron mein daakhil hotey hain. (Bukhari: 3010)"
"1292","[AI-translation] Saab bin Jassaama (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) merey paas se Abwa ya Waddaan mein guzrey. Aur Aap se ghar walon key baarey mein poochha gaya jin par raat ko hamla kya jaata hai, mushrikeen mein se, aur unki auraton aur unki aulaad mein se zakhmi hotey hain. Aap ne farmaya: Wo un mein se hain. (Bukhari: 3012)"
"1293","[AI-translation] Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key baaz ghazwaat mein aik aurat maqtool paai gai. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne auraton aur bachchon key qatl ka inkaar kya. (Bukhari: 3014)"
"1294","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhey pahuncha ke Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ne qaum ko jalaaya. To unhon-ne kaha: Agar main hota to unhey na jalaata kyunke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah key azaab se azaab na do. Aur main unhey qatl karta jaisa Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo apna deen badaley use qatl karo. (Bukhari: 3017)"
"1295","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Cheenti ne Nabiyon mein se Nabi ko kaata. To us ne cheentiyon ki basti ko jalaaney ka hukm diya aur wo jalaai gai. To Allah ne uski taraf wahi ki: Tumhey cheenti ne kaata aur tum ne tasbeeh karney wali ummaton mein se ummat ko jala diya. (Bukhari: 3019)"
"1296","[AI-translation] Jareer (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya tum mujhey Zul Khalasa se aaraam na dogey? Aur wo Khasam mein ghar tha jisey Kaaba-tul-Yamaaniya kaha jaata tha. Unhon-ne kaha: To main Ahmas mein se aik sau pachaas sawaaron key sath nikla. Aur wo ghodon waley they. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur main ghodon par jam na sakta tha. To Aap ne merey seeney mein maara yahan tak ke main ne Aapki ungliyon ka nishaan merey seeney mein dekha. Aur farmaya: Ae Allah! Use saabit rakkh aur use hidaayat denay wala hidaayat paaney wala bana. To wo uski taraf nikla aur use toda aur jalaaya. Phir Aap ki taraf Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko khabar deney key liye bheja. To Jareer key bhejaney waley ne kaha: Qasam us zaat ki jis ne tumhey haq key sath bheja! Main tumharey paas na aaya yahan tak ke main ne use khaali ya khaarish waley oont jaisa chhor diya. Unhon-ne kaha: To Aap ne Ahmas key ghodon aur uskey aadmiyon mein paanch martaba barkat ki dua ki. (Bukhari: 3020)"
"1297","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Kisra halaak hua, phir uskey baad Kisra na hoga. Aur Qaisar zaroor halaak hoga, phir uskey baad Qaisar na hoga. Aur unkey khazaanay Allah key raastey mein zaroor taqseem kiye jaaengey. (Bukhari: 3027)"
"1298","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se) riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ladai ko dhoka karaar diya. (Bukhari: 3028)"
"1299","[AI-translation] Bara bin Aazib (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Uhad key din paidal walon par Abdullah bin Jubair ko muqarrar kya. Aur wo pachaas aadmi they. To Aap ne farmaya: Agar tum hamein dekho ke hamein parindey noch rahey hain to apni is jagah se na hatna yahan tak ke main tumhaari taraf bhejun. Aur agar tum hamein dekho ke ham ne qaum ko shikast dey di hai aur unhey raund diya hai to na hatna yahan tak ke main tumhaari taraf bhejun. To unhon-ne unhey shikast di. Unhon-ne kaha: To main Allah ki qasam auraton ko daudta hua dekh raha tha jabke unkey ghungroo aur unki pindliyaan zaahir ho gaein thein, wo apne kapdey uthaaye huey thein. To Abdullah bin Jubair key saathiyon ne kaha: Ganeemat ae qaum, ganeemat! Tumharey saathi ghaalib aa gaey hain, tum kis ka intezaar kartey ho? To Abdullah bin Jubair ne kaha: Kya tum bhool gaey jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne tum se kaha tha? Unhon-ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Ham zaroor logon key paas aaeengey aur ganeemat mein se paaengey. Phir jab wo unkey paas aey to unkey chehrey mor diye gaey aur wo shikast khaata hua wapas aey. To wo tha jab Rasool unhey unkey peechey bula rahey they. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath baarah aadmiyon key siwa na bacha. To unhon-ne ham mein se sattar ko paa liya. Aur Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur Aap key sahaaba ne Badr key din mushrikeen mein se aik sau chaalees ko paa liya tha: Sattar qaidi aur sattar maqtool. To Abu Sufyan ne kaha: Kya qaum mein Muhammad hain? Teen martaba. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhey jawaab deney se mana kya. Phir us ne kaha: Kya qaum mein Ibn Abi Quhaafa hain? Teen martaba. Phir us ne kaha: Kya qaum mein Ibn Khattab hain? Teen martaba. Phir wo apne sahaaba ki taraf wapas aaya aur us ne kaha: Lekin ye qatl kiye gaey hain. To Umar apne aap par qaabu na rakh sakay aur unhon-ne kaha: Tum ne jhoot kaha, Allah ki qasam ae Allah key dushman! Beshak jinhey tum ne gina wo sab zinda hain. Aur tumharey liye baaqi raha hai jo tumhey bura lagega. Us ne kaha: Din Badr key din jaisa hai aur ladai baari baari hai. Beshak tum qaum mein musla paaogey jiska main ne hukm nahi diya tha aur na mujhey bura laga. Phir wo rajaz padhney laga: Hubal buland ho! Hubal buland ho! Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya tum use jawaab na dogey? Unhon-ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Ham kya kahein? Aap ne farmaya: Kaho: Allah buland aur azeem hai. Us ne kaha: Beshak hamaarey liye Uzza hai aur tumhaarey liye Uzza nahi hai. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya tum use jawaab na dogey? Unhon-ne kaha: Unhon-ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Ham kya kahein? Aap ne farmaya: Kaho: Allah hamaara madadgaar hai aur tumhaara madadgaar nahi hai. (Bukhari: 3039)"
"1300","[AI-translation] Salma (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main Madina se Gaaba ki taraf jaaney key liye nikla. Yahan tak ke jab main Gaaba ki ghaati mein tha to mujhey Abdur Rahman bin Auf ka ladka mila. Main ne kaha: Tum par afsos! Tumhey kya hua? Us ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki doodh waley oontniyaan pakad li gaein. Main ne kaha: Kis ne unhey liya? Us ne kaha: Ghatfaan aur Fazaara ne. To main ne teen cheekhein maarein aur donon kinaron key darmiyaan sunaaya: Ae subah ki (hamla) khabar! Ae subah ki (hamla) khabar! Phir aagey badha yahan tak ke main unhey mila jabke unhon-ne unhey liya hua tha. To main unhey teer maarney laga aur kehta tha: Main Ibn Akwa hun aur aaj doodh peetey bachchon ka din hai. To main ne unhey un se us se pehley bacha liya ke wo piyen. To main unhey haank kar laaya. To mujhey Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) milay. To main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak qaum pyaasi hai aur beshak main ne unhey unka peena peenay mein jaldi karney se rok diya hai. To unkey peechey bhejiye. To Aap ne farmaya: Ae Ibn Akwa! Tum maalik ho gaey ho to narmi karo. Beshak qaum apni qaum mein mehmaan nawaazi paati hai. (Bukhari: 3041)"
"1301","[AI-translation] Abu Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Qaidi ko chhudaao, yaani qaidi, aur bhookay ko khilao aur beemaar ki ayaadat karo. (Bukhari: 3046)"
"1302","[AI-translation] Abu Juhaifa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Ali (Raziallahu anhu) se kaha: Kya tumharey paas wahi mein se kuchh hai Allah ki Kitaab mein jo hai uskey siwa? Unhon-ne kaha: Nahi, qasam us zaat ki jis ne daana phaada aur jaan paida ki! Main use nahi jaanta magar samajh jo Allah aadmi ko Quran mein deta hai aur jo is saheefa mein hai. Main ne kaha: Aur saheefa mein kya hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Diyat aur qaidi ko chhudaana aur ke Musalman kaafir key badley qatl na kya jaey. (Bukhari: 3047)"
"1303","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Ansaar mein se aadmiyon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se ijazat maangi. To unhon-ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Ijazat dijiye ke ham apne bhatijay Abbas ka fidya chhorein. To Aap ne farmaya: Us mein se dirham na chhorna. (Bukhari: 3048)"
"1304","[AI-translation] Salma bin Akwa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas safar mein mushrikeen ka jasus aaya. To wo Aap key sahaaba key paas baitha aur baat karney laga, phir palat gaya. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Use talaash karo aur qatl karo. To us ne use qatl kya aur use uska saamaan diya. (Bukhari: 3051)"
"1305","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne kaha: Jumueraat ka din aur Jumueraat ka din kya hai? Phir wo roey yahan tak ke unkey aansu kankariyon ko geela kar gaey. To unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka dard Jumueraat key din sakht ho gaya. To Aap ne farmaya: Merey paas kitaab laao, main tumharey liye kitaab likhun jiskey baad tum kabhi gumraah na hoge. To wo jhagdey. Aur Nabi key paas jhagadna munaasib nahi hai. To unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) behki behki baat kar rahey hain. Aap ne farmaya: Mujhey chhoro, beshak jis mein main hun wo us se behtar hai jiski taraf tum mujhey bulaatey ho. Aur Aap ne apni maut key waqt teen ki wasiyat ki: Mushrikeen ko Jazeerat-ul-Arab se nikaalo. Aur wafd ko utna do jaisa main unhey deta tha. Aur teesri main bhool gaya. (Bukhari: 3053)"
"1306","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) logon mein khadey huey aur Allah ki uskey shayaan-e-shaan sana ki, phir Dajjaal ka zikr kya aur farmaya: Beshak main tumhey us se daraata hun. Aur koi Nabi nahi magar us ne apni qaum ko us se daraaya hai. Beshak Nuh ne apni qaum ko us se daraaya tha. Lekin main tum se uskey baarey mein baat kahunga jo Nabi ne apni qaum se nahi kahi: Tum jaantey ho ke wo kaana hai aur Allah kaana nahi hai. (Bukhari: 3057)"
"1307","[AI-translation] Huzaifa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Merey liye likho ke logon mein se kis ne Islam ka kalimat kaha hai. To ham ne Aap key liye aik hazaar paanch sau aadmi likhey. To ham ne kaha: Ham dartey hain jabke ham aik hazaar paanch sau hain? To main ne hamein aazmaish mein dekha yahan tak ke aadmi akeley namaz padhta hai jabke wo darta hai. (Bukhari: 3060)"
"1308","[AI-translation] Abu Talha (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke wo jab qaum par ghaalib aatey to maidaan mein teen raatein thehartey. (Bukhari: 3065)"
"1309","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Uska ghoda gaya aur dushman ne use pakad liya. To Musalman us par ghaalib aey aur wo usey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key zamaaney mein wapas kar diya gaya. Aur uska ghulaam bhaag gaya aur Room walon se jaa mila. To Musalman un par ghaalib aey aur use us par Khaalid bin Waleed ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key baad wapas kya. (Bukhari: 3067)"
"1310","[AI-translation] Jaabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Ham ne apni chhoti bakri zibah ki hai aur jau ka saa peesa hai. To Aap tashreef laaeeye, Aap aur giroh. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne cheekh kar farmaya: Ae Khandaq walon! Beshak Jaabir ne khaana tayyaar kya hai. To khush aamdeed tumhey! (Bukhari: 3070)"
"1311","[AI-translation] Khaalid bin Saeed ki beti Umm Khaalid (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas apne waalid key sath aai jabke mujh par zard qameez thi. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Sana sana! Aur wo Habsha ki zabaan mein achha hai. Unhon-ne kaha: To main Nubuwwat ki mohar se khelney gai. To merey waalid ne mujhey daanta. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Use chhoro. Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Puraana karo aur naya pehno, phir puraana karo aur naya pehno, phir puraana karo aur naya pehno. (Bukhari: 3071)"
"1312","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hamaarey darmiyaan khadey huey aur khayaanat ka zikr kya aur use bada karaar diya aur uskey muamley ko bada karaar diya. Aap ne farmaya: Main tum mein se kisi ko Qiyaamat key din na paaun jabke uski gardan par bakri ho jiski aawaaz ho. Uski gardan par ghoda ho jiski aawaaz ho. Wo kahey: Ya Rasulullah! Meri madad kijiye! To main kahunga: Main tumharey liye kuchh nahi rakhta, main tumhey pahuncha chuka hun. Aur uski gardan par oont ho jiski aawaaz ho. Wo kahey: Ya Rasulullah! Meri madad kijiye! To main kahunga: Main tumharey liye kuchh nahi rakhta, main tumhey pahuncha chuka hun. Aur uski gardan par sonay chaandi (ka maal) ho. To wo kahey: Ya Rasulullah! Meri madad kijiye! To main kahunga: Main tumharey liye kuchh nahi rakhta, main tumhey pahuncha chuka hun. Ya uski gardan par kapdey hon jo phadphadaatey hon. To wo kahey: Ya Rasulullah! Meri madad kijiye! To main kahunga: Main tumharey liye kuchh nahi rakhta, main tumhey pahuncha chuka hun. (Bukhari: 3073)"
"1313","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Amr (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key bojh par aadmi tha jisey Kirkara kaha jaata tha. To wo mara. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Wo aag mein hai. To wo usey dekhney gaey aur unhon-ne aba paai jo us ne khayaanat ki thi. (Bukhari: 3074)"
"1314","[AI-translation] Ibn Abi Mulaika se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ibn Zubair (Raziallahu anhu) ne Ibn Jafar (Raziallahu anhu) se kaha: Kya tumhey yaad hai jab ham ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka isteqbaal kya, main aur tum aur Ibn Abbas? Unhon-ne kaha: Haan. To Aap ne hamein utha liya aur tumhey chhor diya. (Bukhari: 3082)"
"1315","[AI-translation] Saaeb bin Yazeed (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai: Ham bachchon key sath Saniyat-ul-Wada tak Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka isteqbaal karney gaey. (Bukhari: 3083)"
"1316","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath they jab Aap Usfaan se wapas aey. Jabke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apni oontni par they aur Aap ne Safiya bint Huyayy ko apne peechey sawaar kya hua tha. To Aapki oontni thokar khai aur wo donon gir padey. To Abu Talha dauday aur unhon-ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Allah mujhey tum par qurbaan karey! Aap ne farmaya: Tum aurat ki (fikr karo). To us ne apne chehrey par kapda palat liya aur uskey paas aaya aur use us par daal diya. Aur un donon key liye sawaari durust ki. To wo donon sawaar huey aur ham ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko gher liya. Phir jab ham Madina par zaahir huey to Aap ne farmaya: Wapas aaney waley, tauba karney waley, ibaadat karney waley, apne Rab ki hamd karney waley. To Aap musalsal wo kehtey rahey yahan tak ke Madina mein daakhil huey. (Bukhari: 3085)"
"1317","[AI-translation] Kaab (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab safar se Chaasht key waqt tashreef laatey to masjid mein daakhil hotey aur baithney se pehley do rakatein padhtey. (Bukhari: 3088)"
